<title>SINGAPORE: Venture, Sumitomo JV see S$200 mln sales.</title>
<headline>Venture, Sumitomo JV see S$200 mln sales.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new Singapore-based joint venture between Venture Manufacturing Ltd and Sumitomo Electric aims for sales of Singapore $200 million by the year 2000, the companies said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>The statement said the joint venture, in which the companies would invest S$20 million over four years, would be operational by August 1997.</p>
<p>The 50-50 joint venture, VS Electronics Pte Ltd, will design, make and market system electronics and related products in Singapore, it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
